{"ID":"20240220132602-2o2n77s","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132602-2o2n77s","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132602-2o2n77s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171747-12gxfi5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171734-3zitd9m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:229,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171747-cxe2ot3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【通脉四逆汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312171747-12gxfi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-12gxfi5","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百三十一条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-khig3k2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-khig3k2","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「少阴病」，下利清谷，里寒外热，手足厥逆，脉微欲绝，身反不恶寒，其人面色赤，或腹痛，或干呕，或咽痛，或利止，脉不出者，「通脉四逆汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-hzxpeln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-hzxpeln","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"少阴会有问题，是因为太阴有问题，太阴的寒湿，没好，越来越盛，影响到少阴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-ge1p7qu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-ge1p7qu","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中焦都是寒湿，下痢清谷，代表里面很冷很寒，东西不消化。这种状况下，里面是寒外面是热。常人里面应该是热的，外面是冷的，所以你摸到皮肤上是冷的，病人身体上是热的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-w00wdy9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-w00wdy9","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"人正中心的地方是心脏搏动，跟小肠中间有个大动脉，正常的心脏搏动到小肠去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。里寒外热，下痢清谷，代表里面寒湿太盛。手脚厥逆，手脚的温度是根据肠胃的温度来的，脾主四肢，所以手脚冷。一般的手脚冷，不见得到手肘，如果手冷到手肘，脚冷到膝盖的时候，就叫做厥逆。四逆汤就是冷到手肘膝盖了，如果手脚冷就是手脚冷，他不会讲四逆。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-oudyvdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-oudyvdn","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“脉微欲绝”里面寒湿很盛。“或腹痛，或干呕，或咽痛，或利止，脉不出者，「通脉四逆汤」主之。”为什么会有利止的现象，因为里面寒湿到了一个阶段以后，寒越来越盛的时候，里面阳已经快绝了，阳要绝，往外走的时候，脸上会看到赤色，这个赤色不应该出现的时间出现，比如说，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们出现的冬天，冬天应该颜色暗一点，但是他看到脸色红的，就是里阳往外走"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以红润的颜色应该是在夏天的时候，春夏的时候，而且红色是均匀的。像他这种面色赤是两颧的地方，这种都是不对，里寒很盛。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-h3c54ly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-h3c54ly","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通脉四逆汤跟四逆汤有点差异。通脉四逆汤，"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-aaokzh1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-aaokzh1","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"通脉四逆汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-nz6tf1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-nz6tf1h","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草二两炙。附子大者一枚，生用，去皮，破八片。干姜三两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-k9s5qg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-k9s5qg5","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水三升，煮取一升二合，取滓，分温再服，其脉即渐出者愈。非若暴出者之自无而忽有，既有而仍无，如灯火之回焰也。面赤色者，加葱九茎。腹中痛者，去葱，加芍药二两。呕者，加生姜二两。若咽痛者，去芍药，加桔梗一两。利止，脉不出者，去桔梗，加人参二两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-kijr4bo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-kijr4bo","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果把干姜减一半，就是一般的四逆汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"重用干姜的时候，就代表要胃中，里面太冷了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-eibqqsa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-eibqqsa","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心脏搏动移热到小肠，就是经过这个大动脉到小肠里面，当里面寒掉了，中焦冷掉，中焦开始寒的时候，有一种病就是动脉血管剥离，就是心和小肠中间的动脉破裂，如果是西医处理就得去医院做个大手术把动脉拿掉给你换个塑胶管上去。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-gr46tdq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-gr46tdq","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个其实可以预测的。像上面条辩没事在那边下痢，里寒外热的时候就会导致破裂。为什么会破裂？寒很盛的时候就会爆裂掉。有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"两种"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"情况，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一种"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是里面堵塞掉了导致的破裂；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一种"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是血管破裂掉了，如果是淤血跑回心脏堵塞掉了，也是寒。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你的末梢如果太冷的时候，血会结块。所以用炮附子下去，很热就化掉了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以当病人四逆，手脚冰冷的，下痢不止，我们知道里寒很盛，看到他里寒的时候就赶快治，不治好动脉血管会剥离。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-flagmuu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-flagmuu","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“其脉即渐出者愈”脉渐出者，病人好了，因为寒是渐渐化掉的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-7ig3v19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-7ig3v19","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“面赤色者，加葱九茎。”"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"葱白能够通表里"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。色白入肺，辛辣也是入肺。为什么不用蒜，蒜色白入肺，但是葱像个管子一样，同时像毛孔。为什么加葱‘九’茎，因为过去的时候九是阳数之极。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-3x3iyeb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-3x3iyeb","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“腹中痛者，去葱，加芍药二两”肚子痛会用芍药，它已经有生附子在里面了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-ri30xre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-ri30xre","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“呕者，加生姜二两。”生姜和干姜同用。两个功能不一样，所以可以同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-zxl5q9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-zxl5q9x","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“若咽痛者，去芍药，加桔梗一两。”桔梗是治疗喉痛的很好的方子，但是桔梗最主要是化痰。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-lw97n09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-lw97n09","updated":"20240312171747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“利止，脉不出者，去桔梗，加人参二两。”就是告诉你，他是虚症，桔梗治痰，但是桔梗不补虚。脉不出就是气脉还没有回来。利停止了，代表病人回来了，但是很虚，才会加人参。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171747-cxe2ot3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171747-cxe2ot3"}},{"ID":"20240312171734-umui3ax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171734-umui3ax","updated":"20240312171734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百八十六条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171734-ndcz8d2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171734-ndcz8d2","updated":"20240312171734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：下利清谷，里寒外热，汗出而厥者，「通脉四逆汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171734-3zitd9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171734-3zitd9m","updated":"20240312171734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“通脉”就是表里能够通。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"里外不通的时候要靠他来通"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。寒利严重的时候，用通脉四逆汤。"}]}]}